        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/ed517dbdd3413848c370769875db77ca.poster.avif?t=1768979293\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/ed517dbdd3413848c370769875db77ca.webm?t=1768979293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>My Eggduck</strong> is a random idle clicker game for your desktop. Keep this derpy and silly duck anywhere you want on your screen!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are now this duck's owner. Take good care of it!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/7a530660eb57fa0f0122e52b58663db3.poster.avif?t=1768979293\" width=186 height=215 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/7a530660eb57fa0f0122e52b58663db3.webm?t=1768979293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the duck, and it will lay an egg with a low probability. (I just love randomness and gacha.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/431edf274c3e3fc558471880eda6c64c.poster.avif?t=1768979293\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/431edf274c3e3fc558471880eda6c64c.webm?t=1768979293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My hand started to hurt from all the clicking, so I also made a nest. Placing the duck in the nest lets it auto-click to lay eggs for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/db71da2bd7bd0dd8e3cf6991d8917187.poster.avif?t=1768979293\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/db71da2bd7bd0dd8e3cf6991d8917187.webm?t=1768979293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, it will lay a golden egg at an even lower chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/61aeb2b0d35b7e91beb9a1bd804ff72a.poster.avif?t=1768979293\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/61aeb2b0d35b7e91beb9a1bd804ff72a.webm?t=1768979293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get new ducks or nests from golden eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/2b518ba63ae53f3698007ba51e9c7ddd.poster.avif?t=1768979293\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/2b518ba63ae53f3698007ba51e9c7ddd.webm?t=1768979293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, sometimes (75%) the egg will be empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/577358910d0c8b49e677a324de9b0dd5.poster.avif?t=1768979293\" width=622 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/577358910d0c8b49e677a324de9b0dd5.webm?t=1768979293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/577358910d0c8b49e677a324de9b0dd5.mp4?t=1768979293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use the collected eggs to enhance the nest's performance. But this is random, too. Try to create the ultimate nest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perks of this game</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watching the cute duck is very relaxing.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your productivity will skyrocket when you work with the duck.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/18c89fa00db5849272e652ae14c75044.poster.avif?t=1768979293\" width=582 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/18c89fa00db5849272e652ae14c75044.webm?t=1768979293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/18c89fa00db5849272e652ae14c75044.mp4?t=1768979293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can place the duck in hilarious spots while watching videos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/c3fc1a8c052a7a23a26b26e2fdf85e17.avif?t=1768979293\" width=557 height=299 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's incredibly satisfying to harvest all the eggs that pile up while you're busy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/2450bd0cba62f7567e90250362e871d4.poster.avif?t=1768979293\" width=912 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/2450bd0cba62f7567e90250362e871d4.webm?t=1768979293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/2450bd0cba62f7567e90250362e871d4.mp4?t=1768979293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1) Optimized for multitasking. </strong><br>We offer various options to ensure the duck doesn't get in your way while you do other things.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle 'Always on Top'.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the game to any monitor in a multi-monitor setup.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle individual sound effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2) Cute in Many Styles</strong> <br><strong> </strong>With a wide variety of duck and nest skins, you can decorate your desktop to match your taste or mood of the day.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >52 duck skins and 11 unique nest skins, and all of them are cute.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change its appearance at any time. (If you're lucky!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3) Get your DuckPamine rush! </strong><br>Don't let its cute looks fool you; this game is all about probability and luck. Spark some DuckPamine in your daily grind!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each click has a chance to lay an egg. You could click forever and get nothing, or get multiple eggs in a row. (Regular Egg: 5%, Golden Egg: 1%)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golden eggs have a chance to contain a skin. (Skin: 25%, Empty: 75%)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to create the ultimate nest through Nest Reforging. (Warning: Highly addictive.)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4) User-Friendly</strong> + <strong>Silly UI</strong><br> To ensure it never gets in your way, we've removed all intrusive UI, leaving just the duck itself. But we didn't sacrifice usability. It also comes with the world's silliest, hand-drawn pixel art UI. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/e7777adee2fae919d25178873071a01b.poster.avif?t=1768979293\" width=912 height=582 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/e7777adee2fae919d25178873071a01b.webm?t=1768979293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/e7777adee2fae919d25178873071a01b.mp4?t=1768979293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The UI is normally hidden but can be easily accessed when needed via multiple ways. (Right-click the tray icon, right-click the duck or its nest, or press the ESC key)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 'Gather Eggs' function for when eggs are scattered or hard to find on your desktop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can move the UI window to any position.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/ed517dbdd3413848c370769875db77ca.poster.avif?t=1768979293\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/ed517dbdd3413848c370769875db77ca.webm?t=1768979293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>My Eggduck</strong> is a random idle clicker game for your desktop. Keep this derpy and silly duck anywhere you want on your screen!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are now this duck's owner. Take good care of it!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/7a530660eb57fa0f0122e52b58663db3.poster.avif?t=1768979293\" width=186 height=215 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/7a530660eb57fa0f0122e52b58663db3.webm?t=1768979293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the duck, and it will lay an egg with a low probability. (I just love randomness and gacha.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/431edf274c3e3fc558471880eda6c64c.poster.avif?t=1768979293\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4169930/extras/431edf274c3e3fc558471880eda6c64c.webm?t=1768979293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My hand started to hurt from all the clicking, so I also made